.DS_Store
# Agent tooling that installs itself into a working repo. None of it is this project's
# source, and bin/scope already declares the same paths as harness outputs so a scoped gate
# run does not escalate on them. Ignoring them here makes git agree with that judgement —
# without it `claude plugin tag` refuses to cut a release, correctly, because the tag would
# not describe a clean tree.
.claude-flow/
.swarm/
.agents/
.claude/agents/
.claude/commands/
.claude/helpers/
.claude/skills/
.claude/memory.db
.claude/proven-config.json
.claude/.proven-config-version
.claude/work/
*.rvf
*.rvf.lock
ruvector.db
agentdb.rvf
